        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Shawl woven in silk and wool. With a white centre almost covered by stylised shawl-type flower and leaf forms. In the deep ends, the elongated cones and long oval-ended panels edged with cinquefoil leaves, are filled with leafy meanders. There is no distinct border. The plain coloured ends contain woven motifs. The warp fringe is loosely twisted. The colours are deep pink, pillar-box red, pale blue, green, black, orange, buff and white."@en ;
